<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electric Fuel cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded Electric Fuel Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1/4 to 6-1/4.</p>
